<view class="page order-detail-page"><view class="page-title">订单详情</view><view class="status-card"><view class="status-text">{{order.statusText}}</view><view class="status-copy">会员权益状态以家庭当前会员中心显示为准</view></view><view class="detail-card"><view class="detail-title">{{order.planName}}</view><view class="detail-row"><text>订单号</text><text>{{order.orderNo}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>商品金额</text><text>¥{{order.originalText}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>优惠减免</text><text class="discount">-¥{{order.discountText}}</text></view><view class="detail-row total"><text>实付金额</text><text>¥{{order.amountText}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{order.couponName}}" class="coupon-used">已使用：{{order.couponName}}</view></view><view class="detail-card"><view class="detail-title">购买说明</view><view class="detail-copy">本订单为会员虚拟服务购买，不支持在小程序内申请退款。若后台已完成退款，订单状态会同步显示为“已退款”。本次购买不会自动续费。</view></view><button wx:if="{{order.canCancel}}" class="cancel-button" bindtap="cancelOrder">取消待支付订单</button></view>
